# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never-publish list.
#
# This repository is a CURATED clone: files are copied in by hand, so in normal
# operation nothing below can arrive here at all. These rules are the second line
# of defence - they make `git add -A` safe if one of these is ever copied in by
# mistake, which is exactly the accident a hand-curated flow is prone to.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

